{"assets":["/statement-assets/662afded2cd04174eaa10e947c858eac0ae235bc7656b6ca9210bfe82f26a14d.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"113","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Sleeping"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One day Vasya was lying in bed watching his electronic clock to fall asleep quicker."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya lives in a strange country, where days have "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h"},{"kind":"text","text":" hours, and every hour has "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes. Clock shows time in decimal number system, in format "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H:M"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", where the string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" always has a fixed length equal to the number of digits in the decimal representation of number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". To achieve this, leading zeros are added if necessary. The string "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"M"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" has a similar format, and its length is always equal to the number of digits in the decimal representation of number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". For example, if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h = 17"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m = 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":", then time equal to 13 hours and 75 minutes will be displayed as \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"13:075"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vasya had been watching the clock from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h1"},{"kind":"text","text":" hours "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m1"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h2"},{"kind":"text","text":" hours "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m2"},{"kind":"text","text":" minutes inclusive, and then he fell asleep. Now he asks you to count how many times he saw the moment at which at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" digits changed on the clock simultaneously."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, when switching 04:19 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 04:20 two digits change. When switching 23:59 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 00:00, four digits change."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider that Vasya has been watching the clock for strictly less than one day. Note that the last time Vasya saw on the clock before falling asleep was \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"h2:m2"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". That is, Vasya "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"didn't see"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" the moment at which time \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"h2:m2"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" switched to the next value."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input file contains three space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ h, m ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ 20"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The second line contains space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m1"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ h1 < h"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ m1 < m"},{"kind":"text","text":"). The third line contains space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"h2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m2"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ h2 < h"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ m2 < m"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single number — the number of times Vasya saw the moment of changing at least "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" digits simultaneously."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please do not use the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"%lld"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" specificator to read or write 64-bit integers in C++. It is preferred to use the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cin"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" stream (also you may use the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"%I64d"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" specificator)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 5 2\n4 4\n2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"24 60 1\n0 0\n23 59\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1439\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"24 60 3\n23 59\n23 59\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example Vasya will see the following moments of time: 4:4 "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/662afded2cd04174eaa10e947c858eac0ae235bc7656b6ca9210bfe82f26a14d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" 0:0 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 0:1 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 0:2 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 0:3 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 0:4 "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/662afded2cd04174eaa10e947c858eac0ae235bc7656b6ca9210bfe82f26a14d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" 1:0 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 1:1 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 1:2 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 1:3 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 1:4 "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/662afded2cd04174eaa10e947c858eac0ae235bc7656b6ca9210bfe82f26a14d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" 2:0 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 2:1 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 2:2 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 2:3 "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":" → "},{"kind":"text","text":" 2:4. Double arrow ("},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/662afded2cd04174eaa10e947c858eac0ae235bc7656b6ca9210bfe82f26a14d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":") marks the sought moments of time (in this example — when Vasya sees two numbers changing simultaneously)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":". Any switching time can be accepted, since during switching of the clock at least one digit is changed. Total switching equals to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"24·60 = 1440"},{"kind":"text","text":", but Vasya have not seen one of them — the switching of 23:59 "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/662afded2cd04174eaa10e947c858eac0ae235bc7656b6ca9210bfe82f26a14d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" 00:00."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example Vasya fell asleep immediately after he began to look at the clock, so he did not see any change."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"113E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/113/problem/E"}